WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.385 --> 00:00:15.548
Bajie waved his rake at the demon Golden Horn.

2
00:00:15.568 --> 00:00:18.450
"You'll never harm the Tang Monk!"

3
00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:19.291
shouted the pig.

4
00:00:19.311 --> 00:00:21.473
"My rake is very powerful!"

5
00:00:24.115 --> 00:00:25.636
rushed toward Golden Horn.

6
00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:32.312
But the demon was strong.

7
00:00:32.612 --> 00:00:33.353
was knocked out.

8
00:00:35.814 --> 00:00:39.115
When he woke up, he was tied up in a dark cave.

9
00:00:45.618 --> 00:00:49.139
"Bajie is taking a long time to search the mountain," said the Tang Monk.

10
00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:51.140
"I hope he's okay."

11
00:00:57.603 --> 00:00:58.683
Wukong frowned.

12
00:00:58.703 --> 00:01:00.564
"He probably went back to sleep.

13
00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:02.681
I should have followed him again."

14
00:01:04.342 --> 00:01:05.963
keep walking," said Wujing.

15
00:01:05.983 --> 00:01:08.424
"We'll find Bajie along the way."

16
00:01:09.645 --> 00:01:12.066
"We must stay alert though," said Wukong.

17
00:01:12.086 --> 00:01:15.628
"We still don't know if there are any demons on this mountain."

18
00:01:16.769 --> 00:01:18.129
group headed up the mountain.

19
00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:20.871
Soon they heard a voice.

20
00:01:22.072 --> 00:01:22.792
"Help me!"

21
00:01:23.052 --> 00:01:23.713
cried a man.

22
00:01:23.733 --> 00:01:26.634
"Someone is in trouble," said the Tang Monk.

23
00:01:27.655 --> 00:01:32.422
He and his companions hurried ahead and found an old monk lying near the road.

24
00:01:34.943 --> 00:01:36.804
goodness!" cried the old monk.

25
00:01:37.344 --> 00:01:38.565
"You must help me."

26
00:01:39.786 --> 00:01:42.167
The Tang Monk got down from his horse.

27
00:01:43.508 --> 00:01:45.069
course we will help you," he said.

28
00:01:48.831 --> 00:01:49.351
stand up."

29
00:01:50.672 --> 00:01:52.333
can't," said the old man.

30
00:01:52.353 --> 00:01:54.014
"My leg is injured.

31
00:01:54.274 --> 00:01:55.355
It hurts terribly."

32
00:01:56.255 --> 00:01:57.336
started to cry.

33
00:01:59.177 --> 00:02:01.418
"How will I ever get back home?"

34
00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:05.181
"Please don't cry," said the Tang Monk.

35
00:02:06.041 --> 00:02:06.642
will help you.

36
00:02:07.382 --> 00:02:08.603
How did your leg get hurt?"

37
00:02:09.404 --> 00:02:12.045
"A tiger attacked me," said the old monk.

38
00:02:13.186 --> 00:02:15.388
Wukong looked suspiciously at the man.

39
00:02:17.189 --> 00:02:19.210
isn't really a monk," he thought.

40
00:02:19.230 --> 00:02:21.512
"I'm sure he wants to harm Master.

41
00:02:22.512 --> 00:02:24.874
But I can't tell Master that—he won't believe me."

42
00:02:24.894 --> 00:02:27.616
"Wukong," said the Tang Monk.

43
00:02:28.268 --> 00:02:30.250
"Please carry this poor monk down the mountain."

44
00:02:33.953 --> 00:02:36.515
Wukong walked over and picked up the old monk.

45
00:02:37.736 --> 00:02:39.457
"Ouch!" cried the monk.

46
00:02:40.498 --> 00:02:42.760
careful, Wukong," said the Tang Monk.

47
00:02:43.441 --> 00:02:44.662
"His leg is hurt badly."

48
00:02:47.364 --> 00:02:48.965
group continued along the road.

49
00:02:50.006 --> 00:02:52.388
Wukong carried the injured monk.

50
00:02:52.849 --> 00:02:56.532
He walked slowly, letting the Tang Monk and Wujing go ahead.

51
00:02:59.112 --> 00:03:01.974
"I know you're really a demon," the monkey whispered.

52
00:03:01.994 --> 00:03:05.156
"And I know you want to eat the Tang Monk."

53
00:03:06.897 --> 00:03:09.358
"I don't know what you're talking about," said the monk.

54
00:03:10.178 --> 00:03:13.300
"I'm just a simple monk who was attacked by a tiger."

55
00:03:14.301 --> 00:03:15.341
Wukong laughed.

56
00:03:15.361 --> 00:03:17.623
"Do you know who I am?

57
00:03:18.683 --> 00:03:19.924
am Sun Wukong.

58
00:03:20.784 --> 00:03:22.966
Heaven's entire army couldn't defeat me.

59
00:03:24.046 --> 00:03:26.728
You're going to wish you'd never tried to harm the Tang Monk."

60
00:03:27.676 --> 00:03:31.759
As Wukong talked, he felt a heavy weight pressing down on him.

61
00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:37.623
He glanced up and realized an entire mountain was balanced on top of his head.

62
00:03:38.264 --> 00:03:39.325
The monkey laughed again.

63
00:03:39.345 --> 00:03:43.948
"So you're going to use magic tricks to trap me under a mountain?

64
00:03:44.789 --> 00:03:49.232
Well, let me tell you—Buddha himself once trapped me under a mountain.

65
00:03:50.153 --> 00:03:51.594
And I was able to lift it."

66
00:03:52.875 --> 00:03:54.496
Wukong felt more weight.

67
00:03:56.204 --> 00:03:58.246
he had two mountains on top of him.

68
00:03:59.287 --> 00:04:00.768
He walked more slowly.

69
00:04:00.828 --> 00:04:04.951
"This still isn't enough weight to stop me," he said.

70
00:04:04.971 --> 00:04:09.974
"Now that the Tang Monk isn't around, I should clobber you with my iron bar."

71
00:04:11.195 --> 00:04:13.036
Suddenly the old monk vanished.

72
00:04:14.637 --> 00:04:17.560
A third mountain appeared on top of the first two.

73
00:04:18.660 --> 00:04:23.564
Wukong's knees buckled, and all three mountains crashed down on top of him.

74
00:04:24.608 --> 00:04:25.749
The monkey was trapped.

75
00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:28.591
The old monk appeared again.

76
00:04:29.612 --> 00:04:33.875
There was a flash of light as he changed back into his demon form.

77
00:04:36.397 --> 00:04:38.558
Golden Horn laughed with delight.

78
00:04:38.579 --> 00:04:43.002
"Wukong was the most powerful of these travelers.

79
00:04:43.822 --> 00:04:46.204
will be easy to defeat Wujing.

80
00:04:47.325 --> 00:04:49.847
Tonight I will dine on the Tang
